+serampore-press | 1800..1837 | Serampore | language, religion, technology | east | Serampore Mission Press | The Serampore Mission Press | The Serampore Mission Press, founded by the British Baptist missionaries William Carey and his colleagues, published books and newspapers at Serampore, then Danish India, from 1800 to 1837. | From 1800 a printing press at Serampore in Bengal printed books and newspapers.
