+olympics-1928 | 1928 | Amsterdam | daily, arts | abroad | India at the 1928 Summer Olympics | India's first Olympic gold | At the 1928 Summer Olympics in Amsterdam, India competed in men's field hockey for the first time and won the gold medal. It was the country's first gold, and began a winning streak in the sport that lasted through the 1956 Games. | In 1928 India's hockey team won the country's first Olympic gold medal. India went on winning the hockey gold until 1956.
