+pather-panchali | 1955 | West Bengal | arts | east | Pather Panchali | Pather Panchali | Pather Panchali is a 1955 drama film written and directed by Satyajit Ray, his first as a director. It is an adaptation of Bibhutibhushan Bandyopadhyay's 1929 Bengali novel. Lack of funds stretched its production over nearly three years. | Pather Panchali is a famous Bengali film from 1955, the first by the director Satyajit Ray. It took almost three years to make because money kept running out.
